# The key file is opened O_NOFOLLOW and every check runs against that DESCRIPTOR
# (banshee-czn). The previous shape called symlink_metadata(path) and then
# read_to_string(path) — two independent path lookups, so anyone able to write the
# containing directory had a TOCTOU window to swap a validated regular file for a
# symlink. Dropping the flag reopens it.
file: rust/banshee-api/src/auth.rs
test: a_symlinked_key_file_is_neither_read_nor_replaced
---OLD---
    opts.read(true).custom_flags(libc::O_NOFOLLOW);
---NEW---
    opts.read(true);
